# U -- PAW setup (HBS construction), rebuilt 2026-09-27
# Replaces u_ndlss_v0 (see AUDIT.md), which the setup audit flagged.
# Parameters: CP-PAW parameters/stp.cntl entry U_HBS_SC; projectors
#   NPRO=2 2 2 1 (two per s/p/d channel: the recipe that removed
#   the NiO incompleteness collapse).
#   Matching radii RCL/RCOV scaled by 1.1 relative to stp.cntl.
#   NOTE: the replaced setup u_ndlss_v0 was standard;
#   this one is semicore (different ZV), because
#   no clean setup of the original variant was found.
# Checked: builds for an isolated atom (PBE) with no ghost state and no
#   incompleteness warning. NOT yet validated in solids (lattice constants,
#   cutoff convergence) unless stated in AUDIT.md.
#
  !SPECIES NAME='U_' NPRO=2 2 2 1 LRHOX=4 RAD/RCOV=1.2
    !AUGMENT ID='U_HBS_SC' EL='U' ZV=14. TYPE='HBS'
             RBOX/RCOV=1.2 RCSM/RCOV=0.25
             RCL/RCOV= 0.550 0.550 0.550 0.550
             LAMBDA= 6. 6. 6. 6.
      !GRID DMIN=1.E-6 DMAX=0.1 RMAX=10. !END
      !POT  POW=3. RC/RCOV=0.5 !END
      !CORE POW=3. RC/RCOV=0.5 !END
    !END
  !END
